# Home-screen buttons for the phone (Termux:Widget). One per line:  name | command | keep-open
#   keep-open = yes → waits for Enter before closing, so you can read the result
ArdaOS        | exec fish -l                 | no
AI chat       | arda ask chat                | no
Ask AI        | arda ask                     | yes
Find cameras  | arda cams                    | yes
Receive files | arda share receive           | no
Status        | arda status                  | yes
Update ArdaOS | arda update                  | yes
Matrix        | cmatrix -C blue              | no
